    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842330/extras/d1e6209908a5f895c48204868e653061.avif?t=1752038573\" width=1920 height=1080 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a new story in the Dungeon Dreams universe and a perfect entry point for new players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your avatar starting from your background in the crumbling streets of \u00a0Haruka's Lowtown, under siege by mysterious elemental forces!, Shape your story with skills, tactics, races, traits, and choices acquired during your adventure (and before!).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Import your saved data</strong> from\u00a0<strong>Dungeon Dreams 2</strong>\u00a0to influence the world state, shaping events, cities, and the fates of familiar characters in Dungeon Dreams Wanderers!\u00a0No save file? No problem\u2014you can\u00a0<strong>design your own custom world history</strong>\u00a0at the start of the game, defining key events, alliances, and legacies that will shape your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin your story oppressed and in debt in the underbelly of Haruka, but forge your own destiny: join the legendary Ramjalars, and travel through the vast world of Dungeon Dreams (Haruka, Kalmaruss, Nightvale, Chelbo, Tremec and more) exploring exotic cities, deserts, forests, and ancient ruins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong> Meet, bond with, and recruit companions</strong> during your travels\u2014each with their own story (with multiple potential outcomes)\u00a0and unique abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>World exploration.</strong>\u00a0From the magic city of Kalmaruss to the merchant haven of Padavil, to the mysterious Nightvale woods and beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong> Choices matter: Roleplaying is at the heart of Dungeon Dreams Wanderers</strong>. Shape your alignment, relationships, and the fate of entire cities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- &quot;Camp&quot; map </strong>where you can hang out with your travelling companions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-</strong>Introducing new mechanics:\u00a0<strong>tactics</strong> and\u00a0<strong>origins</strong>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- New Game Plus included</strong>! Make different choices, take new paths, and discover hidden endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet leading characters like Chloe, a scrappy dreamer from Lowtown, Kael, a gifted wild mage, Musa, a mysterious Ramjalar, and many more\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Party companions that you can romance,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other companions that you can still develop a friendship with and end up with, but it's not a romantic relationship,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Town npcs you can have a fling with\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Total quests in the QuestLog: still adding, at least 40</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Total towns and major cities to explore: at least 13</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Total world regions: 5 major regions (and hidden ones\u2026)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842330/extras/bf507acb9f704c8c2ccad5bdf18ed4a3.poster.avif?t=1752038573\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842330/extras/bf507acb9f704c8c2ccad5bdf18ed4a3.webm?t=1752038573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842330/extras/bf507acb9f704c8c2ccad5bdf18ed4a3.mp4?t=1752038573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842330/extras/c32dc064064ec0d2fd5ac7fb23b0d9aa.poster.avif?t=1752038573\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842330/extras/c32dc064064ec0d2fd5ac7fb23b0d9aa.webm?t=1752038573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842330/extras/c32dc064064ec0d2fd5ac7fb23b0d9aa.mp4?t=1752038573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842330/extras/002675f1276f1e719615eb3b4b84fb4c.poster.avif?t=1752038573\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842330/extras/002675f1276f1e719615eb3b4b84fb4c.webm?t=1752038573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842330/extras/002675f1276f1e719615eb3b4b84fb4c.mp4?t=1752038573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842330/extras/ffffa18362b7e4d137996b59cb485815.poster.avif?t=1752038573\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842330/extras/ffffa18362b7e4d137996b59cb485815.webm?t=1752038573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842330/extras/ffffa18362b7e4d137996b59cb485815.mp4?t=1752038573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b</p>",
